BUGS
     _D_e_l_i_v_e_r_m_a_i_l sends one copy of the letter to each user; it
     should send one copy of the letter to each host and distri-
     bute to multiple users there whenever possible.

     _D_e_l_i_v_e_r_m_a_i_l assumes the addresses can be represented as one
     word.  This is incorrect according to the ARPANET mail pro-
     tocol RFC 733 (NIC 41952), but is consistent with the real
     world.

     It isn't _s_e_n_d_m_a_i_l (this may be a feature).

